+Another similar case involves truncations on 64-bit targets:
+
+  %361 = sdiv i64 %.046, 8                        ; [#uses=1]
+  %362 = trunc i64 %361 to i32                    ; [#uses=2]
+...
+  %367 = icmp eq i32 %362, 0                      ; [#uses=1]
